 "complete": true,
 "notes": "ilsos.gov opened fine in the browser. The SOS 'all plates' guide lists 68 tiles (plain <img>, so it works as robot_url) and the game already has every specialty plate on it except EMS Chief and the Military Series. The Military Series page has 46 plates, and the game has only Korean War Veteran, so the other 45 are listed as new (year unknown; most predate 2023). Skipped Municipal Fire (fire-department vehicles only), Autocycle, trailer and truck plates. The SOS calls the club plate just 'Chicago Fire'. Nothing retired: every game specialty plate is still listed. 'Recreational' and the B/C, farm, flat-weight and mileage entries in the game are vehicle-class plates, not specialty plates, and the guide doesn't list them as such. Series pages (Collegiate, Pan Hellenic, Sporting) were not expanded, since the game treats each as one plate. Police K-9 Memorial and 100 Club plates are not listed yet."
}